        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Manganiello, Flash Thompson, Peter Parker, Alec Baldwin, Salma Hayek, Bridget Moynahan, Natalia Cigliuti, Jim Gaffigan, Ben Platt\n- Roles: Alcide Herveaux\n- Works: Spider-Man trilogy, ER, How I Met Your Mother, One Tree Hill, True Blood, Drunk Parents\n- Concepts: high school football, bullying, friendship, admiration of superheroes\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Manganiello played Flash Thompson in Sam Raimi's Spider-Man trilogy.\n- Joe Manganiello had recurring television roles on ER, How I Met Your Mother, and One Tree Hill before his breakout role.\n- Joe Manganiello's breakout role was werewolf Alcide Herveaux on the HBO series True Blood.\n- Flash Thompson is a star high school football player who mercilessly bullies his classmate Peter Parker.\n- Flash Thompson greatly admires Spider-Man, creating an irony that Spider-Man enjoys.\n- Flash Thompson and Peter Parker become close friends in college.\n- The film Drunk Parents stars Alec Baldwin, Salma Hayek, Bridget Moynahan, Joe Manganiello, Natalia Cigliuti, Jim Gaffigan, and Ben Platt.",
